ng", "id": "1696637708132244", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1696637714798910_4946681219789494925_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ed-Lv8oZidQQ7kNvwHPcFpl&_nc_oc=AdqT6PpUNYjsy1DwwZDy305aSzHlCZ6XbbLsrLRUXJnRhA5YuLiffuHYeTfmGy7kyj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS37Sh4mIEA1b0Axq3MIrIU2zxCFoNtJ4RBnwsyz27_4w&oe=6B0C7B91"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "4383046621951627", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_4383046625284960_6704386613672609703_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=exmReb--v7cQ7kNvwEAElZF&_nc_oc=AdoTdAIeo-x33O7WyOO4aGjWalfz_txbVUTPyI_5uCNgLiBHsceW2LZmpNBP3v4aC1Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQvuh-3-5nTcFlTrRCn8PbE2oB9Wpfs2MCUQX6laGqZ8g&oe=6B0C8275"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "851768347981596", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_851768351314929_2053146473754133296_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F3pjyYjzMLIQ7kNvwEvnKbA&_nc_oc=Adqvn4zrjoUwzEsn0saPqCqzcC4ZSdnRKiik_t7DCSQka_cFB1t2xKJXreaP506p0fY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT3-4sZ90jxOEWDg31_Dpa8W3M4fZgDIWk0G7r8qAGZ1A&oe=6B0C6D00"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1632542594489813", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_1632542597823146_3689544893099760675_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nXhuK2Yb2EAQ7kNvwF-2HwU&_nc_oc=AdpgYo-aCCa8Z09cn8UXngk_JLVLmqGT4RR5vSModQnbhn8-BP2U4DRjJuef0IeMPpI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRauFhNAv9OBRsKuxKkeQhHVkWijen2Zdzid-8vPAgZbg&oe=6B0C549D"}, "display_name": "Cortex Quest", "keywords": ["educational", "science", "biology", "ear", "psychology"], "long_description": "**WARNING:** This game must be played by at least 2 people. One player is immersed in VR, while their partner must have the Support File in hand: https://cortexquest.github.io/VR.\n# Train your brain. Become the system.\n\nStep into a VR experience where science meets gameplay. CORTEX QUEST is a collection of immersive mini-games for anyone ready to explore the mysteries of the human brain and sensory systems.\n\n# PSYCHOLOGY SIMULATIONS - Perception is not reality\n\nExperience neurological disorders and how perception can dramatically change.\n\nExplore three fascinating conditions:\n\n- Prosopagnosia - struggle to recognize faces and rely on alternative cues\n- Hemineglect - navigate a world where half of reality seems to disappear\n- Body Ownership Impairment - question what truly belongs to your own body\n\nEach simulation challenges your senses and shows how the brain constructs reality.\n\n# BIOLOGY ADVENTURE - HEAR WE GO!\n\nA scientific accident has changed everything\u2026 Your team of biologists has been miniaturized and sent inside the human body. Your mission: explore the auditory system and uncover how we perceive sound.\n\nEquipped with advanced VR tools, you will:\n\n- Dive into the cochlea and uncover its mechanics\n- Activate hair cells and observe how sound becomes signals\n- Manipulate sound frequencies to understand pitch perception\n- Trigger action potentials and follow neural pathways\n- Travel to the auditory cortex\n\nLearn hearing by doing, experimenting, and interacting.", "short_description": "CORTEX QUEST is an educational two-player VR experience where one player explores the brain and body, while a partner guides them through puzzles about perception, neurological disorders, and hearing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://novascience.github.io/VR/PrivacyPolicy/CortexQuestPrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dawson College", "support_website_url":